      "flags": 4,
      "color": 0,
      "is_bold": false,
      "is_italic": false
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "content": "B. Use AWS Organizations to deploy accounts. Create a networking account that has a VPC with\nprivate subnets and public subnets. Use AWS Resource Access Manager (AWS RAM) to share the\nsubnets with the workload accounts.",
    "page_number": 15,
    "bbox": [
